1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:07,253
Part 12 mein schemes aur free goods: 10 plus 2 jaisi quantity scheme, percentage discount,

2
00:00:07,253 --> 00:00:12,777
company-wide scheme, sirf kuch chemists ke liye scheme, special rates,

3
00:00:12,777 --> 00:00:16,250
aur free goods ka stock aur margin par asar.

4
00:00:17,197 --> 00:00:19,756
Masters mein Schemes kholiye.

5
00:00:19,756 --> 00:00:27,344
Do tarah ki schemes hoti hain: Free goods, yaani buy X get Y free, aur Extra discount.

6
00:00:27,344 --> 00:00:33,873
Scheme ek product par ho sakti hai, ya kisi company ke saare products par.

7
00:00:34,574 --> 00:00:42,249
List mein dekhiye: Febrinil 650 par 10 plus 2, Sanjivani ki poori range par 10 plus 1,

8
00:00:42,249 --> 00:00:48,407
Prana ke vitamins par extra 5 percent, aur Montiluk LC par 20 plus 3,

9
00:00:48,407 --> 00:00:51,709
jo sirf do bade chemists ke liye hai.

10
00:00:51,709 --> 00:00:54,922
Har scheme ki validity date bhi hai.

11
00:00:55,605 --> 00:00:58,654
Nayi scheme banate hain.

12
00:00:58,654 --> 00:01:01,068
New scheme kholiye.

13
00:01:01,068 --> 00:01:08,056
Code: ORS20P4, naam: ORSiva 20 plus 4, type Free goods.

14
00:01:08,056 --> 00:01:10,851
Product ORSiva Sachet.

15
00:01:10,851 --> 00:01:15,425
Buy 20, free 4, minimum quantity 20.

16
00:01:16,100 --> 00:01:19,863
Valid from aaj se, valid to 31 March tak.

17
00:01:19,863 --> 00:01:28,123
Show to chemists on the portal tick kariye, taaki chemist portal par bhi yeh scheme dikhe.

18
00:01:28,123 --> 00:01:29,224
Save scheme.

19
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:35,396
Ab dekhte hain scheme order par apne-aap kaise lagti hai.

20
00:01:35,396 --> 00:01:40,138
Naya invoice kholiye, chemist Kokar Health Point.

21
00:01:40,138 --> 00:01:43,234
Febrinil 650 ke 10 packs jodiye.

22
00:01:43,234 --> 00:01:47,492
Free column mein 2 packs aa gaye: 10 plus 2.

23
00:01:48,147 --> 00:01:50,114
Quantity 25 kariye.

24
00:01:50,114 --> 00:01:57,152
Scheme poore slab par lagti hai, yaani do baar 10, toh free 4 packs.

25
00:01:57,152 --> 00:02:00,671
Bache hue 5 packs par scheme nahi.

26
00:02:00,671 --> 00:02:03,983
Calculation bilkul nishchit hai.

27
00:02:04,656 --> 00:02:06,956
Ab ORSiva ke 40 sachets.

28
00:02:06,956 --> 00:02:12,513
Abhi banayi gayi 20 plus 4 scheme turant lag gayi: 8 free.

29
00:02:12,513 --> 00:02:19,700
Calvita D3 jodne par Prana ka 5 percent discount Disc column mein aata hai.

30
00:02:20,384 --> 00:02:24,599
Taxable value sirf bike hue packs par banti hai.

31
00:02:24,599 --> 00:02:30,218
Free packs ki keemat zero hai, par stock se woh bhi kat-te hain.

32
00:02:30,218 --> 00:02:38,032
Isliye free goods ka asar margin par padta hai: maal gaya, paisa sirf paid packs ka aaya.

33
00:02:38,032 --> 00:02:39,964
Raise invoice dabaiye.

34
00:02:40,630 --> 00:02:45,479
Invoice par Free column mein 4 aur 8 packs saaf chhape hain,

35
00:02:45,479 --> 00:02:49,278
aur stock se 29 Febrinil aur 48 ORSiva kam hue.

36
00:02:49,278 --> 00:02:56,552
Scheme report MIS mein hai, aur business intelligence mein scheme profitability batati hai

37
00:02:56,552 --> 00:02:59,946
ki kaunsi scheme se bikri sach mein badhi.

38
00:03:00,620 --> 00:03:08,477
Special rates chemist ki profile mein set hote hain: kisi ek chemist ke liye kisi product

39
00:03:08,477 --> 00:03:10,949
ka net rate, ek tareekh tak.

40
00:03:10,949 --> 00:03:15,628
Jaise Lalpur Life Care ke liye Pantovista 110 rupaye.

41
00:03:15,628 --> 00:03:19,336
Yeh PTR aur PTS se upar priority leta hai.

42
00:03:20,005 --> 00:03:23,748
Yaad rakhiye: scheme ki end date hamesha daaliye,

43
00:03:23,748 --> 00:03:27,108
company se mila scheme hi chemist ko dijiye,

44
00:03:27,108 --> 00:03:32,073
aur scheme report har mahine dekhiye taaki margin par nazar rahe.

45
00:03:33,757 --> 00:03:42,660
Part 13 mein wholesale GST invoice: chemist chunna, PTR aur PTS rates, discount aur scheme,

46
00:03:42,660 --> 00:03:50,780
same-state par CGST aur SGST, doosre state par IGST, HSN, invoice number, A4 print,

47
00:03:50,780 --> 00:03:52,737
aur invoice history.

48
00:03:53,707 --> 00:03:56,080
Sales mein New invoice kholiye.

49
00:03:56,080 --> 00:04:02,128
Yeh direct ya counter billing hai, jab chemist khud aakar ya phone par maal le.

50
00:04:02,128 --> 00:04:08,175
Order wale maal ka invoice packed order se banta hai, jo Part 15 mein dekhenge.

51
00:04:08,888 --> 00:04:13,385
Chemist chuniye: City Care Chemists, Ranchi.

52
00:04:13,385 --> 00:04:20,642
Yeh Jharkhand ka chemist hai, aur hamara godown bhi Jharkhand mein hai.

53
00:04:20,642 --> 00:04:23,810
Isliye yeh same-state sale hai.

54
00:04:23,810 --> 00:04:30,556
Products jodte hain: Amoxirise CV 625, Azivon 500, aur Telmiva 40.

55
00:04:31,225 --> 00:04:38,665
Har line par rate chemist ke price tier se aata hai: PTR retailer ke liye, PTS stockist ke liye.

56
00:04:38,665 --> 00:04:42,230
Disc column mein extra discount de sakte hain,

57
00:04:42,230 --> 00:04:47,733
par rate ghatane ya extra discount ke liye override permission chahiye.

58
00:04:48,462 --> 00:04:55,856
Neeche summary dekhiye: taxable value, discount, aur CGST plus SGST.

59
00:04:55,856 --> 00:05:02,271
Same state hone se GST aadha CGST aur aadha SGST mein bata.

60
00:05:02,271 --> 00:05:08,360
12 percent GST matlab 6 percent CGST aur 6 percent SGST.

61
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:10,970
Round off ke baad total.

62
00:05:11,651 --> 00:05:13,442
Raise invoice dabaiye.

63
00:05:13,442 --> 00:05:18,165
Medoro stock FEFO se batch-wise kaatata hai, credit limit,

64
00:05:18,165 --> 00:05:24,679
overdue bills aur licence validity check karta hai, aur invoice number deta hai.

65
00:05:25,346 --> 00:05:26,932
Yeh hai invoice.

66
00:05:26,932 --> 00:05:35,459
Number godown ki series se banta hai: W, godown code, financial year aur kram sankhya,

67
00:05:35,459 --> 00:05:38,929
GST ke 16 akshar ki seema ke andar.

68
00:05:38,929 --> 00:05:47,357
Upar place of supply Jharkhand, aur har line mein HSN, batch, expiry, quantity, free,

69
00:05:47,357 --> 00:05:48,646
rate aur GST.

70
00:05:49,322 --> 00:05:56,299
Print dabaane par A4 tax invoice ka layout khulta hai: distributor ka naam, GSTIN,

71
00:05:56,299 --> 00:06:01,829
drug licence, chemist ki details, HSN-wise lines aur tax summary.

72
00:06:01,829 --> 00:06:06,934
Isse printer par chhapa ya PDF mein save kiya jaa sakta hai.

73
00:06:07,634 --> 00:06:13,766
Ab doosre state ka chemist: Patna Demo Medical Agency, Bihar.

74
00:06:13,766 --> 00:06:16,279
Wahi products jodte hain.

75
00:06:16,279 --> 00:06:23,013
Summary mein ab CGST aur SGST ki jagah IGST aaya, poora 12 percent,

76
00:06:23,013 --> 00:06:26,230
aur Inter-state: IGST likha hai.

77
00:06:27,248 --> 00:06:34,523
Yeh place of supply ke niyam se hota hai: maal doosre state mein jaa raha hai, toh IGST.

78
00:06:34,523 --> 00:06:39,731
Medoro chemist ke GSTIN ya state se yeh apne-aap tay karta hai.

79
00:06:39,731 --> 00:06:45,022
Phir bhi tax ka faisla GST niyamon ke hisaab se hi hona chahiye,

80
00:06:45,022 --> 00:06:47,668
aur shak ho toh CA se poochhiye.

81
00:06:48,399 --> 00:06:55,133
Invoices screen par saare invoices ki history hai: number, chemist, date aur total.

82
00:06:55,133 --> 00:07:00,731
Chemist ya number se search, aur date range se filter kar sakte hain.

83
00:07:01,391 --> 00:07:05,682
Invoice same din cancel ho sakta hai, reason ke saath,

84
00:07:05,682 --> 00:07:10,132
aur tab stock aur chemist ka balance wapas ho jaata hai.

85
00:07:10,132 --> 00:07:17,443
Purane invoice ke liye cancel nahi, balki credit note banta hai, jo agle part mein dekhenge.

86
00:07:18,098 --> 00:07:23,820
E-invoice IRN aur e-way bill abhi government portal par hi banaye jaate hain.

87
00:07:23,820 --> 00:07:30,286
Medoro mein inka integration abhi wired nahi hai, aur settings mein yeh saaf likha hai.
